    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d428">

                <pb facs="0596" n="504" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg504"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 654.51251/1</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Page</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-03-14T23:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 14, 1918, 11 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.55 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>9060. For the Acting Secretary only [from Stevens]:</p>
                <p>Delegates of Allied Powers in session as Allied Maritime Transport Council have
                    unanimously agreed upon dispositions, making possible to send to Italy amount of
                    coal absolutely for military and civil requirements. … Stevens.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Page</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
